  "body": "The tbody element really should support max-height. This would allow you to create a table with a thead that is always visible as you scroll the tbody.\r\n\r\n```\r\n<table>\r\n<thead>\r\n   <tr>.......</tr>\r\n</thead>\r\n<tbody>\r\n   <tr>.......</tr>\r\n   <tr>.......</tr>\r\n   <tr>.......</tr>\r\n   <tr>.......</tr>\r\n   <tr>.......</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n```\r\n\r\nOriginal Post: [here](https://github.com/w3c/html/issues/1423)",
